\chapter{Mining Intelligence}
\label{chap:mining}

Contributing as a miner on Bittensor is, at its core, no different from solving
any real-world Machine Learning problem: define the task precisely, understand
the data, engineer meaningful features, train and validate candidate models,
and rigorously evaluate the result before deploying it into production. This
chapter walks through that exact process, end to end, for the subnet chosen
